            <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; color: #64748b; background: #fefce8; border: 1px solid #fef08a; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; gap: 8px; align-items: flex-start;">
                <i class="fas fa-lock" style="color: #ca8a04; margin-top: 2px;"></i>
                <span><strong>Protected Transaction:</strong> Funds remain securely in PackBang Admin Escrow. Payout is released to the supplier only after you receive and confirm the products.</span>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" id="submitPaymentBtn" class="payment-btn-submit">
                <i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Confirm & Deposit to Admin Escrow
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

